<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= titulo %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/logo.png" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css" />
  <style>
    .notfound { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 24px; }
    .notfound img { height: 56px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .notfound h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .notfound p { color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 24px; }
    .notfound a { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="notfound">
    <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="StockFácil" />
    <h1>Página no encontrada</h1>
    <p>El enlace que seguiste no existe o se movió.</p>
    <a href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
